<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Station Casinos raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Station Casinos raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Credit Suisse First Boston said it raised Station Casinos Inc to buy from hold on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed on the New York Stock Exchange at 8-3/4 on Thursday.  </p>
<p>-- Analyst David Anders was not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
